{"id":"wb-7-506","name":"唐朝墩古城遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"唐朝墩古城遗址","text":"唐朝墩古城遗址是坐落在中华人民共和国新疆维吾尔自治区昌吉回族自治州奇台县的古遗址。唐朝墩古城是唐朝蒲类县县治所在地，高昌回鹘时期、西辽、蒙元时期沿用，于15世纪废弃。古城遗址现为中华人民共和国全国重点文物保护单位。唐朝墩面积约面积约16万平方米，北侧城墙保存较好，因其中段有一高大土墩，古城遗址得名“唐朝墩”，城内有古罗马浴场、景教寺院、佛教寺院等建筑遗迹，出土有佛像、壁画、陶器、铁器等遗物。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%94%90%E6%9C%9D%E5%A2%A9%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":93217127,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93217127","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/9b57c4b73096b734a7252f6a.jpg","title":"唐朝墩古城遗址.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%94%90%E6%9C%9D%E5%A2%A9%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/22/%E5%94%90%E6%9C%9D%E5%A2%A9%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"HaziiDozen","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​唐朝墩古城遗址","width":320,"height":240}}